{"parse": {"title": "洛基-04", "pageid": 94306, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B4%9B%E5%9F%BA-03\" title=\"洛基-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">洛基-04</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B4%9B%E5%9F%BA-05\" title=\"洛基-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">洛基</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">04</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.B4.AB\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"紫\">紫</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 紫</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Purple</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-bangongshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"bangongshi\"><img alt=\"bangongshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Cg-bangongshi.png/600px-Cg-bangongshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Cg-bangongshi.png/900px-Cg-bangongshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Cg-bangongshi.png/1200px-Cg-bangongshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>沙发上似乎有一条剧本堆成的蚕在蛹动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>报纸上的标题为《迷影谍大败！票房毒药，菲林士多》。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>唉……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这不是艺术沙龙的电话，他们不会邀请数次让公司亏本的导演。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>阿琳！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>高跟鞋的跑步声逐渐靠近，似乎还有几摞文件掉在了路上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿琳：</div><div>怎么了？菲林士多导演？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>嗯？你最近为什么总是穿这套紫色的衣服？之前那套呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿琳：</div><div>……太旧了，不穿了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>是吗？我还挺喜欢那套的……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-baiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"baiping\"><img alt=\"baiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/600px-Cg-baiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/900px-Cg-baiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/1200px-Cg-baiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div> <br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><span style=\"color:#000000\"><br /><span style=\"font-size:138%\"><span style=\"text-align:right\">紫  1984</span></span></span></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-bangongshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"bangongshi\"><img alt=\"bangongshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Cg-bangongshi.png/600px-Cg-bangongshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Cg-bangongshi.png/900px-Cg-bangongshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Cg-bangongshi.png/1200px-Cg-bangongshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>刚才是谁的电话？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿琳：</div><div>和往常一样，骚扰电话罢了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>说完，阿琳叹了口气，自己是从什么时候开始对骚扰电话感到麻木了呢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿琳：</div><div>这是今天的报纸，这是你不感兴趣的公司文件，这个是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿琳拿起信封翻看了一下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿琳：</div><div>一封勒索信。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>哦？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>菲林士多起了兴致，伸手让阿琳把她从沙发上拉起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>让我看看。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/HeadIconSmall-311113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/HeadIconSmall-311113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/HeadIconSmall-311113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>嗯……菲林士多小姐，你好。如果你不想这张照片被公之于众的话，请在明日前将……1、2、3、4……才这么几个零？打进这个账户……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311112.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e0/HeadIconSmall-311112.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311112.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311112.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e0/HeadIconSmall-311112.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311112.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e0/HeadIconSmall-311112.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311112.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>……时间截止在三天前？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>阿琳……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>菲林士多有些埋怨地看着阿琳，随后扬起信封，一张黑黢黢的照片从信封中滑落了出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿琳：</div><div>它被行政当成骚扰信件，随手丢在碎纸机旁边了，要不是阿师发现了，估计我们永远都看不到它了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿琳理了理跑乱的头发。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿琳：</div><div>……也不是，至少能在报纸上看到。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她熟练地将一摞摞报纸中的文娱版抽出来，盖住了泡面桶与废纸团，平铺在菲林士多面前的桌子上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>很快，二人便在报纸的边角处找到了菲林士多的那张照片。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>前名导夜训员工，木偶死去活来！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿琳：</div><div>这……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>照片本就不太清晰，印在报纸上后更是模糊不清，阿琳只能在一片黑乎乎的底色中看见一点像是灯光的白点，别的什么都看不清。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>现在我的黑料就只剩这么一点点版面了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>菲林士多不太满意地用手比量了一下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>比阿正都还小一点！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿琳：</div><div>是前员工的爆料吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>不是，他们拍到了我在指导阿正它们拍影片的照片罢了，无趣，会动的小木偶而已！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>菲林士多索然无味地把手背到了脑后。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>我还以为他们又挖出什么猛料了……还不如看看那堆文件。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿琳：</div><div>……是关于新电影的计划书。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>看你的表情，他们拒绝投资。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿琳点点头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>菲林士多有些罕见地沉默了，对于最先适应她的改变的阿琳来说，有些令她心疼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>看来，在几部电影亏损以后，“名导”这个名头也不好使了啊……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>菲林士多侧头看着墙上的奖杯，轻声笑了一下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>没有了票房作保证，这几个就真成我仅剩的“吃饭”的家伙了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>午饭的时候就用这个喝汤，用那个举着矛的当叉子……可能有点重。至于那个方形的，可以用来当烛台。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>菲林士多随意地分配着电影获得的奖杯，它们放在书柜的最高处，除了最右侧的几座，其余的已经随着时间而积下了不同程度的灰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿琳：</div><div>菲林士多导演，现在就不要开玩笑了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但菲林士多并没有回应她，只是万分珍爱地看着那一排奖杯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在最左边的奖杯上贴着一张拍立得的照片，由于经常被窗帘缝中透漏过来的夕阳照射，照片的一角已经有些许褪色。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_5_at_xinyishusanjie.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_5_at_xinyishusanjie\"><img alt=\"2_5_at_xinyishusanjie\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/Cg-2_5_at_xinyishusanjie.png/600px-Cg-2_5_at_xinyishusanjie.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/Cg-2_5_at_xinyishusanjie.png/900px-Cg-2_5_at_xinyishusanjie.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/Cg-2_5_at_xinyishusanjie.png/1200px-Cg-2_5_at_xinyishusanjie.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>照片的最中央是菲林士多、何日君和奇星三人笑容满面地捧着一尊奖杯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在照片之外，菲林士多的眼中，剧组的众人正围簇在一起，每个人的脸上都是意气风发，那是C07系列电影拿下的第一个奖项。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311114.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-311114.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311114.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311114.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-311114.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311114.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-311114.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311114.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>那时可真是风光无两，再看看迷影谍，票房倒数，奖杯倒是捧回来三座。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311111.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311111.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311111.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311111.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311111.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311111.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311111.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311111.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>叫好不叫座呀……呵……什么用都没有。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>菲林士多沉默了一会，再次开了口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311115.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-311115.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311115.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311115.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-311115.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311115.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-311115.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311115.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>帮我把那张照片拿下来吧，阿琳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女助手走上前去，将照片取下来递给了轮椅上的人。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-bangongshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"bangongshi\"><img alt=\"bangongshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Cg-bangongshi.png/600px-Cg-bangongshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Cg-bangongshi.png/900px-Cg-bangongshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Cg-bangongshi.png/1200px-Cg-bangongshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>然后，把能卖的都卖掉吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿琳：</div><div>什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>帮我把能卖掉的东西都卖掉，包括公司、奖杯、房子、车子……但是那个电影工作室里的东西你需要帮我留一下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿琳：</div><div>那您住哪里呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>只是从雇人打工变成给人打工嘛，又不是去流浪了。我还有这间办公室和这个沙发呢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>菲林士多豪气地拍拍沙发，女助手震惊地看着自己的老板，分不清这是否又是她的一个玩笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿琳：</div><div>然后呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>把钱当做《花闹春喜日》的启动资金。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿琳：</div><div>……您是认真的吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>菲林士多有些不舍地点了点头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>《迷影谍》《明明》《斯默拉之冰》，我已经连亏三部了，没人会愿意再在我身上下赌注。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>再这样下去，我只会离开电影行业……我需要这部电影，我要抓住这个机会来向世人证明菲林士多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>如果这些钱不够，我就去攒局，请人牵线搭桥，直到把资金筹齐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿琳：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿琳看着语气坚定的菲林士多，她还是那个模样，但内里却像是换了个人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>通过社交来换取拍电影的机会，三年前的她怎么会想到这些？她只想嗅着银盐的味道，沉浸在那二维的世界中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但现在她已经走出来了，走到了人世里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿琳：</div><div>菲林士多导演，您真的变了很多……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>菲林士多冲阿琳笑了笑，驱使着轮椅来到了窗户边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311111.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311111.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311111.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311111.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311111.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311111.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311111.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311111.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>阿君离开之后，我才意识到我之前有多依赖她，没有了她，我甚至都不能在激烈的竞争中保住自己现有的地位。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311110.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-311110.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311110.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311110.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-311110.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311110.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-311110.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311110.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>为了能一直留在人们的视野中，甚至为了登上更大的舞台，我必须学着像“何日君”们那样思考。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-311101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-311101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-311101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>这部电影便是我涅槃的证明，所以，付上全部身家，我也要把它拍出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311114.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-311114.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311114.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311114.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-311114.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311114.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-311114.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311114.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>这可能是我最后的机会了哦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>窗户的玻璃上映出菲林士多的微笑，但在阿琳看来这并不和善可亲。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿琳：</div><div>所以即使是现在，您也在观察着我的反应，以供揣摩吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-311101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-311101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-311101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>别讲的这么无情嘛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>菲林士多低下头去，她的表情无法再从玻璃上窥见。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿琳：</div><div>好的，我会为您去办。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿琳：</div><div>哦，对了，以及，这里还有一封医院发来的信函。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿琳：</div><div>医生依旧坚持希望您完成康复治疗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-311101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-311101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-311101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>放在桌子上吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>菲林士多回头看去，阿琳已经离开了办公室。盖在黑料报纸上的，是一封水蓝色的信函。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311111.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311111.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311111.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311111.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311111.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311111.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311111.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311111.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>医院啊……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311111.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311111.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311111.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311111.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311111.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311111.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311111.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311111.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>信封的颜色和今天的天空很像。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>菲林士多坐在窗前，一言不发地等着阿琳的回信，直到夕阳西下，天色已经化为一摊暗橙色。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-bangongshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"bangongshi\"><img alt=\"bangongshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Cg-bangongshi.png/600px-Cg-bangongshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Cg-bangongshi.png/900px-Cg-bangongshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Cg-bangongshi.png/1200px-Cg-bangongshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿琳：</div><div>菲林士多导演。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>嗯？你回来了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>菲林士多的声音中饱含着困倦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿琳：</div><div>《花闹春喜日》，您可以定一个开机的时间了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>嗯——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>菲林士多伸了一个懒腰，用手轻轻地拍了拍那封水蓝的信函。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>让医生先等等吧，现在我有更重要的事要办。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "洛基-04"}}